  <content:encoded><![CDATA[
    <div class='beehiiv'><style>
  .bh__table, .bh__table_header, .bh__table_cell { border: 1px solid #C0C0C0; }
  .bh__table_cell { padding: 5px; background-color: #FFFFFF; }
  .bh__table_cell p { color: #2D2D2D; font-family: 'Helvetica',Arial,sans-serif !important; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
  .bh__table_header { padding: 5px; background-color:#F1F1F1; }
  .bh__table_header p { color: #2A2A2A; font-family:'Trebuchet MS','Lucida Grande',Tahoma,sans-serif !important; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
</style><div class='beehiiv__body'><div class="image"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/4450cdc9-9a5d-48ee-a3ef-fdbdb057b739/Beehiiv_Issue_1_cover__1200x630_.png?t=1794834614"/></div><h1 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is"><span style="background-color:#F17279;">The broker channel is growing. So is the paperwork.</span></h1><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Welcome to <b>Operating Advantage</b>, a weekly note from the partners at EPL Group. Each issue takes one question about where capital meets operating know-how, answers it with data, and shares what we are building and where to meet us. No pitches, no fund offerings.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>The question</b></p><h2 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="why-does-a-growing-broker-channel-s"><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><b>Why does a growing broker channel still check files by hand?</b></span></h2><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Canadians are moving to mortgage brokers. In Mortgage Professionals Canada&#39;s February 2026 survey, 38% of recent buyers used a broker, up six points, and 48% of first-time buyers did (<a class="link" href="https://www.mpamag.com/ca/mortgage-industry/industry-trends/why-more-canadians-are-choosing-brokers-over-banks-in-2026/583678?utm_source=operating-advantage&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is-the-paperwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">CMP, July 2026</a>).</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Each file is also harder to place. Nearly 80% of brokers sent deals to five or more lenders in 2025, up from 73%, and brokers named documentation overload among their main challenges (<a class="link" href="https://www.mpamag.com/ca/best-in-mortgage/the-best-mortgage-lenders-in-canada-according-to-brokers-brokers-on-lenders/545751?utm_source=operating-advantage&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is-the-paperwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">CMP Brokers on Lenders, September 2025</a>). Every lender brings its own rules and its own document list.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">And volume stays high. CMHC expects about 1.15 million mortgages to renew in 2026 and another 940,000 in 2027 (<a class="link" href="https://www.mpamag.com/ca/mortgage-industry/industry-trends/what-to-expect-from-canadas-2026-mortgage-renewal-wave/558668?utm_source=operating-advantage&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is-the-paperwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">CMP, December 2025</a>).</p><div class="image"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/d6e2ef8f-eb25-43e8-b454-39b3197549fd/Issue_1___Broker_channel_in_three_numbers__1200x620_.png?t=1794834637"/></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Our view:</b> more files, more lenders and more rules land on the same number of broker hours. The fastest gain is catching what is missing before the file leaves the broker, not after the lender sends it back.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>From the studio</b></p><h2 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="mortgage-flow"><span style="color:#F17279;"><b>MortgageFlow</b></span></h2><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">MortgageFlow, built in our xPL Ventures studio, is an AI pre-underwriting tool for Canadian mortgage brokers. It reviews a borrower&#39;s file against what lenders require before submission, so the broker finds the gaps first, not the lender.</p><div class="image"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/ee8d359d-0e6f-49b9-b459-e483ce71733e/image.jpeg?t=1794832657"/></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Watch the MortgageFlow product vision.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><span style="background-color:#F17279;"><a class="link" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xVU6AgQ35HjGJ0fN8Ezei15KChs1vlnz/view?utm_source=operating-advantage&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is-the-paperwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><b>Watch the product vision</b></a></span></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><b>Meet us in Miami</b></span></p><h2 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="december-in-miami-two-conversations"><b>December in Miami: two conversations for family offices and dealmakers</b></h2><div class="image"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/cdf748aa-b916-4490-8937-a01743cb9eb5/image.jpeg?t=1794832657"/><div class="image__source"><a class="image__source_link" href="https://eplgroup.co/events?utm_source=operating-advantage&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is-the-paperwork" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><span class="image__source_text"><p>Tuesday 1 December and Thursday 3 December, Miami.</p></span></a></div></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Tuesday 1 December · 5 to 11 PM</b></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>After the Midterms: AI, Cyber Risk and the Next Investment Cycle.</b> A private dinner for a small group of family office principals at a waterfront villa in Miami Beach.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Thursday 3 December · 9:30 to 11:30 AM ET</b></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>The Sunbelt Acquisition Playbook: Creating Value Through Strategic Acquisitions.</b> A breakfast conference and closed-room debate on lower-middle-market private equity deals in Florida, for single family offices, PE principals, corporates, attorneys and dealmakers. Miami Downtown Development Authority, Citigroup Building, 201 S Biscayne Blvd, Suite 2600.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Both events are invite only. One form covers both: tick one or both events, complete your investor profile, and a partner confirms your seat.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><span style="background-color:#F17279;"><a class="link" href="https://eplgroup.co/events?utm_source=operating-advantage&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is-the-paperwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><b>Reserve your seat</b></a></span></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Your turn</b></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Brokers and lenders: which document holds up a file most often? Reply to this email. We read every answer.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Jerome Davant and the EPL Group partners</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><a class="link" href="https://eplgroup.co/insights?utm_source=operating-advantage&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is-the-paperwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Read on eplgroup.co/insights</a> · <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/epl-group-inc?utm_source=operating-advantage&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=the-broker-channel-is-growing-so-is-the-paperwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Follow EPL Group on LinkedIn</a></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><i>For information only. Nothing in this newsletter is an offer to sell or a solicitation of an offer to buy any security. EPL Group is not a registered broker-dealer; securities are offered through Finalis Securities LLC.</i><br><br></p></div><div class='beehiiv__footer'><br class='beehiiv__footer__break'><hr class='beehiiv__footer__line'><a target="_blank" class="beehiiv__footer_link" style="text-align: center;" href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2Fd180ffaa-aece-4187-8f60-2523515b5690%2FBeehiiv_publication_logo__800x800_.png%3Fv%3D1794973011&publication_name=Operating+Advantage+by+EPL+Group&utm_campaign=d2965268-70da-47bf-aafa-20920afde940&utm_medium=post_rss&utm_source=operating_advantage_by_epl_group">Powered by beehiiv</a></div></div>
